WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.254
Look up!

00:00:01.454 --> 00:00:05.773
We are inspired by the suspended umbrellas on Alba Iulia Street.

00:00:05.973 --> 00:00:10.013
This installation brought colour to a street connecting the squares.

00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:16.204
We sway gently in the museum; outside, the decoration’s presence and appearance can change over time.
